WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.004
I had no idea that Netflix was in my house

00:00:04.045 --> 00:00:06.297
in my room.

00:00:06.297 --> 00:00:13.221
This is insane.

00:00:13.304 --> 00:00:14.014
Meet Chet.

00:00:14.014 --> 00:00:16.266
He's a ten year old kid from Brooklyn,
New York.

00:00:16.266 --> 00:00:18.810
We heard Chet is a huge One Piece fan.

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:21.187
My son is obsessed with One Piece.

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:24.774
I'm wondering if there's anything
you guys can do to solidify him

00:00:24.774 --> 00:00:27.027
as being, like, the number one
One Piece fan.

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:30.572
We decided to surprise him with a total
room makeover.

00:00:30.655 --> 00:00:34.367
I think just being so immersed in it,
he probably would turn his room

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:37.287
into a One Piece room,
one way, shape or form.

00:00:37.287 --> 00:00:41.166
For two months, our team worked on designing
the One Piece room of Chet's dreams.

00:00:41.249 --> 00:00:45.211
It included custom
One Piece wallpaper, a captain's quarters,

00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:48.298
tons of fun
One Piece toys and decorations,

00:00:48.298 --> 00:00:50.592
and a pirate ship bed of his own.

00:00:50.592 --> 00:00:54.345
His room right now is sort of like what
his mom and I wanted his room to be.

00:00:54.345 --> 00:01:02.645
So this would be a good opportunity
for him to make his room his own.

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:03.396
with only

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:07.275
48 hours to transform his room
from top to bottom and three flights

00:01:07.275 --> 00:01:10.695
of stairs to bring everything up,
every second counted.

00:01:10.779 --> 00:01:14.282
You got to get this and this.

00:01:14.365 --> 00:01:17.327
Up there.

00:01:17.327 --> 00:01:19.079
Assuming we could fit

00:01:19.079 --> 00:01:36.346
the pieces inside their apartment.

00:01:36.429 --> 00:01:37.972
That was a close one.

00:01:37.972 --> 00:01:48.483
Literally.

00:01:48.566 --> 00:01:50.693
From there, we drilled, painted,

00:01:50.693 --> 00:01:54.531
hung up and styled the rest of the room
to bring the world of One Piece to life.

00:01:54.739 --> 00:02:02.622
for Chet.

00:02:02.705 --> 00:02:04.040
Time is running out

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:17.762
and we still had so much to do.

00:02:17.846 --> 00:02:24.435
Just in time for the finishing touches.

00:02:24.519 --> 00:02:25.395
Chet came home,

00:02:25.395 --> 00:02:30.567
but had no idea what he was about to walk into.

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:31.693
Hello?

00:02:31.693 --> 00:02:32.986
Surprise.

00:02:32.986 --> 00:02:33.820
Hey, Chet.

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:36.823
Hey, Chet.

00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:39.325
We're from Netflix.

00:02:39.325 --> 00:02:48.960
Okay.

00:02:49.043 --> 00:02:52.755
Oh, my.

00:02:52.839 --> 00:02:54.299
Whoa!

00:02:54.299 --> 00:02:56.050
Oh my god.

00:02:56.050 --> 00:03:01.681
They put a whole boat in here.

00:03:01.764 --> 00:03:05.351
Oh, my.

00:03:05.435 --> 00:03:06.519
Jeez!

00:03:06.519 --> 00:03:08.354
There you go. 
So much One Piece!

00:03:08.354 --> 00:03:12.901
This is insane.

00:03:12.984 --> 00:03:13.318
Hello.

00:03:13.318 --> 00:03:16.154
This is Chester
coming in from the straw hat crew.

00:03:16.154 --> 00:03:19.032
I feel like I'm on the ship right now.

00:03:19.032 --> 00:03:21.284
You wanna try?

00:03:21.284 --> 00:03:23.953
and I can now steer myself into sleep.

00:03:25.872 --> 00:03:27.832
I feel like Loofie right now.

00:03:27.916 --> 00:03:33.171
I had no idea that Netflix was in my house
right now and in my room.

00:03:33.213 --> 00:03:34.672
There's so much cool stuff.

00:03:34.672 --> 00:03:39.344
We got the magnifying glass.
We got the Going Mary, too.

00:03:39.344 --> 00:03:41.930
We even have the chop shop fruit.

00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:44.933
And we got the transponder snail.

00:03:45.016 --> 00:03:46.684
It’s a full boat,
so now I'm sleeping on a boat.

00:03:46.684 --> 00:03:49.020
right now I'm in the crew's quarters.

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:51.648
A spyglass.
A magnifying glass.

00:03:51.648 --> 00:03:54.025
and of course, I'm a pirate,
so I have to have treasure.

00:03:54.025 --> 00:03:54.901
Of course.

00:03:54.901 --> 00:03:58.112
We got the Jolly Roger.

00:03:58.196 --> 00:03:59.530
Like a true pirate!

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:01.991
I'm so surprised. I can't even believe it.

00:04:01.991 --> 00:04:02.784
Thank you, Netflix!

